00:32:21,147 --> 00:32:23,441
‪-Wait.
‪-It's already set up.

657
00:32:25,985 --> 00:32:27,070
<i>‪Hello, everyone.</i>

658
00:32:27,153 --> 00:32:30,448
<i>‪We will now begin the third main match</i>
<i>‪of</i>‪ The Devil's Plan.

659
00:32:30,531 --> 00:32:32,033
<i>‪After yesterday's prison match,</i>

660
00:32:32,116 --> 00:32:34,535
<i>‪JAE JAE and Ha Seok-jin were eliminated.</i>

661
00:32:34,619 --> 00:32:37,413
<i>‪There are now nine players remaining.</i>

662
00:32:37,497 --> 00:32:40,875
<i>‪Now, let me introduce</i>
<i>‪the third main match.</i>

663
00:32:40,959 --> 00:32:44,337
<i>‪Today's main match is Gem Black Market.</i>

664
00:32:44,420 --> 00:32:45,254
‪"Gem"?

665
00:32:45,338 --> 00:32:46,714
<i>‪In Gem Black Market,</i>

666
00:32:46,798 --> 00:32:50,426
<i>‪players will exchange cards</i>
<i>‪to identify the cards in the buyer's slot</i>

667
00:32:50,510 --> 00:32:52,971
<i>‪and earn points.</i>

668
00:32:53,054 --> 00:32:54,263
<i>‪Before the game begins,</i>

669
00:32:54,347 --> 00:32:58,476
<i>‪players will draw lottery balls</i>
<i>‪to determine the base order.</i>

670
00:32:58,559 --> 00:33:02,563
<i>‪Player markers will be placed</i>
<i>‪on the board in base order,</i>

671
00:33:02,647 --> 00:33:06,192
<i>‪and a Piece auction will be held</i>
<i>‪to determine the first player.</i>

672
00:33:06,693 --> 00:33:07,986
‪Going first must be an advantage.

673
00:33:08,069 --> 00:33:10,655
<i>‪The Piece auction will be held in secret,</i>

674
00:33:10,738 --> 00:33:15,118
<i>‪and the player who bids the most Pieces</i>
<i>‪will be the first player.</i>

675
00:33:15,201 --> 00:33:19,205
<i>‪Players who do not win the auction</i>
<i>‪will receive their submitted Pieces back.</i>

676
00:33:19,288 --> 00:33:23,209
<i>‪If multiple players are tied</i>
<i>‪for </i><i>‪the </i><i>‪highest </i><i>‪bid,</i>

677
00:33:23,292 --> 00:33:26,212
<i>‪those players will hold another auction.</i>

678
00:33:26,754 --> 00:33:28,464
<i>‪Once the first player is determined,</i>

679
00:33:28,548 --> 00:33:30,925
<i>‪the turn order will be arranged</i>
<i>‪starting from the first player,</i>

680
00:33:31,009 --> 00:33:34,429
<i>‪following the base order</i>
<i>‪set by the lottery balls.</i>

681
00:33:34,512 --> 00:33:37,015
<i>‪In Gem Black Market,</i>
<i>‪there are 11 numbered gem cards</i>

682
00:33:37,098 --> 00:33:43,479
<i>‪of four types, diamond,</i>
<i>‪gold, </i><i>‪silver, </i><i>‪and </i><i>‪bronze,</i>

683
00:33:43,563 --> 00:33:47,108
<i>‪along with 2 bomb cards of -6 and -4,</i>

684
00:33:47,191 --> 00:33:50,153
<i>‪making a total of 13 cards.</i>

685
00:33:50,236 --> 00:33:52,864
<i>‪The dealer will shuffle the 13 cards,</i>

686
00:33:52,947 --> 00:33:54,782
<i>‪and starting from the first player's slot,</i>

687
00:33:54,866 --> 00:33:58,453
<i>‪they will distribute one card </i><i>‪face </i><i>‪down</i>
<i>‪to each </i><i>‪player's </i><i>‪slot.</i>

688
00:33:59,287 --> 00:34:02,206
<i>‪Of the remaining cards after distribution,</i>

689
00:34:02,290 --> 00:34:04,333
<i>‪three will be placed in the buyer's slot,</i>

690
00:34:05,001 --> 00:34:07,962
<i>‪and one will be placed</i>
<i>‪in </i><i>‪the </i><i>‪discard </i><i>‪pile.</i>

691
00:34:08,046 --> 00:34:09,922
<i>‪Once the cards are distributed,</i>

692
00:34:10,006 --> 00:34:14,093
<i>‪players will check their cards in turn,</i>
<i>‪starting from the first player.</i>

693
00:34:14,177 --> 00:34:18,181
<i>‪Afterward, players may only check</i>
<i>‪their cards on their own turn.</i>

694
00:34:19,098 --> 00:34:22,018
<i>‪In Gem Black Market,</i>
<i>‪two card exchanges will be conducted</i>

695
00:34:22,101 --> 00:34:24,187
<i>‪in a specific order each round.</i>

696
00:34:24,270 --> 00:34:25,772
