<i>‪-The first exchange</i>

697
00:34:25,855 --> 00:34:28,149
<i>‪will proceed in forward order,</i>

698
00:34:28,232 --> 00:34:30,777
<i>‪and the second in reverse order.</i>

699
00:34:30,860 --> 00:34:36,115
<i>‪This means the first player </i><i>‪will </i><i>‪be</i>
<i>‪the first and last to exchange cards.</i>

700
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:37,241
