<i>‪or the card in the discard pile.</i>

705
00:34:49,212 --> 00:34:52,215
<i>‪If the player holds a bomb card,</i>

706
00:34:52,298 --> 00:34:56,302
<i>‪they cannot exchange it with a card</i>
<i>‪in the buyer's slot or the discard pile.</i>

707
00:34:56,385 --> 00:34:59,806
<i>‪They must exchange it</i>
<i>‪with another player's card.</i>

708
00:35:00,431 --> 00:35:04,936
<i>‪If another player takes the bomb card</i>
<i>‪through an exchange,</i>

709
00:35:05,019 --> 00:35:07,563
<i>‪its original owner</i>
<i>‪will immediately earn three points.</i>

710
00:35:08,981 --> 00:35:11,984
<i>‪However, if the bomb card's owner</i>
<i>‪initiated the exchange,</i>

711
00:35:12,068 --> 00:35:14,320
