712
00:35:15,446 --> 00:35:17,907
<i>‪Once during the game,</i>

713
00:35:17,990 --> 00:35:19,367
<i>‪players may spend one Piece</i>

714
00:35:19,450 --> 00:35:24,372
<i>‪to check either a card in the buyer's slot</i>
<i>‪or the card in the discard pile.</i>

715
00:35:25,123 --> 00:35:26,999
<i>‪Once both exchanges are complete,</i>

716
00:35:27,083 --> 00:35:29,752
<i>‪all cards on the board will be revealed.</i>

717
00:35:30,837 --> 00:35:36,008
<i>‪Players who hold the same type of gem card</i>
<i>‪as the one in the buyer's slot</i>

718
00:35:36,092 --> 00:35:39,679
<i>‪will earn points equal</i>
<i>‪to the number on their card.</i>

719
00:35:40,513 --> 00:35:45,226
<i>‪If multiple gem cards in the buyer's slot</i>
<i>‪are of the same type,</i>

720
00:35:45,309 --> 00:35:49,355
<i>‪players will earn points multiplied</i>
<i>‪by the number of matching gem cards.</i>

721
00:35:50,106 --> 00:35:53,693
<i>‪If a player earns points</i>
<i>‪with a diamond card,</i>

722
00:35:53,776 --> 00:35:56,404
<i>‪they will receive one Piece immediately.</i>

723
00:35:57,071 --> 00:35:58,322
<i>‪At the end of each round,</i>

724
00:35:58,406 --> 00:36:00,533
<i>‪players holding bomb cards</i>

725
00:36:00,616 --> 00:36:04,537
<i>‪will lose points</i>
<i>‪equal to the minus value on the card.</i>

726
00:36:04,620 --> 00:36:08,749
<i>‪Player scores will be revealed</i>
<i>‪at the end of every round.</i>

727
00:36:09,417 --> 00:36:12,753
<i>‪The player holding the </i><i>‪-6 </i><i>‪bomb </i><i>‪card</i>

728
00:36:12,837 --> 00:36:16,591
<i>‪will become the first player</i>
<i>‪in the next round.</i>

729
00:36:17,592 --> 00:36:22,889
<i>‪If the -6 bomb card</i>
<i>‪is in the buyer's slot or discard pile,</i>

730
00:36:22,972 --> 00:36:25,474
<i>‪the player holding the </i><i>‪-4 </i><i>‪bomb </i><i>‪card</i>

731
00:36:25,558 --> 00:36:27,185
<i>‪will become the first player.</i>

732
00:36:27,268 --> 00:36:29,812
<i>‪If no player is holding a bomb card,</i>

733
00:36:29,896 --> 00:36:32,690
<i>‪the first player will remain the same</i>
<i>‪as in the previous round.</i>

734
00:36:33,733 --> 00:36:38,029
<i>‪The game will conclude once three rounds</i>
<i>‪have been completed in the same manner.</i>

735
00:36:38,821 --> 00:36:42,825
<i>‪We will now explain</i>
<i>‪how final scores are calculated.</i>

736
00:36:42,909 --> 00:36:43,951
‪There's more?

737
00:36:45,161 --> 00:36:46,537
<i>‪In Gem Black Market,</i>

738
00:36:46,621 --> 00:36:49,957
<i>‪every player will have</i>
<i>‪a designated secret friend.</i>

739
00:36:50,041 --> 00:36:50,917
‪"Secret friend"?

740
00:36:51,417 --> 00:36:52,585
‪What's this now?

741
00:36:52,668 --> 00:36:56,797
<i>‪A secret friend affects</i>
<i>‪each player's final score.</i>

742
00:36:56,881 --> 00:36:57,798
<i>‪Before the game begins,</i>

743
00:36:57,882 --> 00:37:01,510
<i>‪players will draw fruit cards</i>
<i>‪to determine their secret friend.</i>

744
00:37:02,178 --> 00:37:04,639
<i>‪Each card has a pre-assigned position</i>

745
00:37:04,722 --> 00:37:06,974
<i>‪in the one-way secret friend chain.</i>

746
00:37:07,058 --> 00:37:08,976
