<i>‪they can check whose secret friend</i>
<i>‪they have become </i><i>‪in </i><i>‪the </i><i>‪dealer </i><i>‪room.</i>

748
00:37:13,898 --> 00:37:18,319
<i>‪In other words, players will learn</i>
<i>‪whose score they will be affecting.</i>

749
