1502
01:09:50,186 --> 01:09:52,146
‪-So you want me to take the minus card?
‪-What?

1503
01:09:52,229 --> 01:09:53,647
‪Do you want me to take the minus bomb?

1504
01:09:53,731 --> 01:09:56,275
‪Do that or hold at zero.

1505
01:09:56,358 --> 01:10:00,779
‪Our original plan was to attack Kyung-lyul

1506
01:10:00,863 --> 01:10:03,157
