1592
01:13:37,830 --> 01:13:39,373
‪-Congratulations.
‪-Thank you.

1593
01:13:41,291 --> 01:13:43,585
<i>‪Round 2 will now begin.</i>

1594
01:13:43,669 --> 01:13:45,212
<i>‪The cards will be distributed.</i>

1595
01:13:52,428 --> 01:13:56,140
‪This round, let's use Pieces
‪to check the cards in the buyer's slot.

1596
01:13:57,015 --> 01:13:58,976
