1599
01:14:03,605 --> 01:14:05,524
‪Round 3 is just defense.

1600
01:14:08,527 --> 01:14:10,571
‪-Join us.
‪-This is so frustrating.

1601
01:14:10,654 --> 01:14:11,822
‪-Join us.
‪-Seriously.

1602
01:14:12,781 --> 01:14:14,241
‪-I'd like that, of course.
‪-Right.

1603
01:14:14,324 --> 01:14:16,994
‪-I'll take whatever.
‪-I'll be a good secret friend for you too.

1604
01:14:18,745 --> 01:14:20,456
