‪-We are.

1610
01:14:39,308 --> 01:14:42,436
‪-We're not. Seriously, stop saying that.
‪-Don't worry. We're good.

1611
01:14:42,519 --> 01:14:43,604
‪-Okay.
‪-We're fine.

1612
01:14:43,687 --> 01:14:46,482
