‪during strategy sessions.

1614
01:14:49,818 --> 01:14:52,362
‪-We couldn't find our footing.
‪-We can still pull through. It's not over.

1615
01:14:52,446 --> 01:14:53,780
‪-Right.
‪-It's okay.

1616
