‪if someone did it like earlier.

1631
01:15:28,857 --> 01:15:31,693
‪-Right, John can do it.
‪-John was great at organizing it.

1632
01:15:37,741 --> 01:15:39,701
‪Jung Won-young, please check your card.

1633
01:15:41,078 --> 01:15:43,038
‪Take it upon yourselves

1634
01:15:43,121 --> 01:15:45,040
