‪I figured it out.

1639
01:16:07,020 --> 01:16:08,146
‪I got it.

1640
01:16:08,230 --> 01:16:09,606
‪We're not losing.

1641
01:16:09,690 --> 01:16:10,899
‪-Don't worry.
‪-Okay.

1642
01:16:19,575 --> 01:16:20,701
‪Okay.

1643
01:16:23,287 --> 01:16:25,289
‪-We're going first this round.
‪-We need to use Pieces.

1644
01:16:25,372 --> 01:16:27,416
