1648
01:16:31,962 --> 01:16:34,131
‪Yurisa, please check your card.

1649
01:16:38,885 --> 01:16:41,638
‪XITSUH, please check your card.

1650
01:16:44,641 --> 01:16:47,185
‪Kim Dong-jae, please check your card.

1651
01:16:48,395 --> 01:16:49,479
‪Guys, don't worry.

1652
01:16:49,563 --> 01:16:52,065
‪-Okay.
‪-Don't worry.

1653
01:16:52,149 --> 01:16:54,860
‪Lastly, Jang Dong-min,
‪please check your card.

1654
01:17:04,870 --> 01:17:05,912
‪Let's go upstairs.

1655
