‪I've figured out the secret friend chain
‪based on their scores.

1656
01:17:10,834 --> 01:17:12,836
‪Kyung-lyul, XITSUH,

1657
01:17:13,587 --> 01:17:17,841
‪-Dong-min, Yurisa, and then Dong-jae.
