1658
01:17:17,924 --> 01:17:20,427
‪The person who drew Dong-jae is Won-young,

1659
01:17:20,927 --> 01:17:23,347
‪Hyun-min drew Won-young,

1660
01:17:23,430 --> 01:17:25,390
‪John drew Hyun-min,

1661
01:17:26,058 --> 01:17:28,352
‪Hyun-gyu drew John,

1662
01:17:28,435 --> 01:17:29,978
‪and Kyung-lyul drew Hyun-gyu.

1663
01:17:30,062 --> 01:17:31,563
‪Here's why.

1664
01:17:31,647 --> 01:17:34,191
‪Their strategy hasn't changed at all.

1665
01:17:34,274 --> 01:17:35,275
‪Not a single change.

1666
01:17:35,359 --> 01:17:38,737
‪John took the -6 card
‪to keep you in check.

1667
