‪the two negative points…

1669
01:17:43,825 --> 01:17:45,243
‪-To get a positive number.
‪-Right.

1670
01:17:45,327 --> 01:17:46,662
‪They were trying to keep you in check,

1671
01:17:46,745 --> 01:17:48,705
‪and Hyun-gyu took the -4 card
‪to flip John's score.

1672
01:17:48,789 --> 01:17:53,335
‪Kyung-lyul only scored a little
‪because they don't know who impacts him.

1673
01:17:53,418 --> 01:17:55,045
‪So he only took three points as a counter.

1674
01:17:55,128 --> 01:17:59,257
